<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Amic Industries raises stake in Haggie to 52 pct.</title>
<headline>Amic Industries raises stake in Haggie to 52 pct.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Amic Industries Ltd (AIL) has increased its stake in Haggie Ltd to 52 percent with the acquisition of 3.4 million shares, AIL said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>It said the transaction done through Scaw Metals, a division of Amic Industries, follows an announcement in March this year of Amic's intention to raise its stake in Haggie from 36 percent.</p>
<p>--Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
